1: """RLCD hyperparameter sweep — parallel GPU utilization (2026-09-27).
2: 
3: Runs a small grid per arm (proper_score: w_sph × lr; bt_pairs: β × margin)
4: as concurrent single-GPU worker processes (two by default — the RTX 3090
5: comfortably holds two batch-8 ModernBERT-large trainings). Each run trains
6: with save=False (no 1.6 GB writes) and reports decision-level val metrics;
7: best config per arm is printed. CPU stays free for dataset generation /
8: closed-loop workers.
9: 
10: Usage:
11:     .venv/bin/python scripts/sweep_rlcd.py --workers 2
12: """
