97: class UniformPolicy:
98:     """Samples uniformly over ALL 8 ActionTypes (vs RandomPolicy's 5).
99: 
100:     Per codex (gpt-6-sol) Q-T2 review: a true state-aware uniform is preferred
101:     over RandomPolicy for ablation, because RandomPolicy currently samples only
102:     from 5 action types (excluding RETRAIN_SURROGATE / SURROGATE_ACQUISITION /
103:     STOP variants that already exist as actions) and the asymmetry can bias
104:     Gate 4 results. UniformPolicy also fills in valid params (n_samples,
105:     step, tol, seed) for the parameterized actions so the action is
106:     budget-feasible.
107: 
108:     Distinct from RandomPolicy in two ways:
109:       1. samples over all 8 ActionTypes (not 5).
110:       2. requires explicit valid-param construction for parameterized actions
111:          (GLOBAL_EXPLORATION, LOCAL_EXPLOITATION, UNCERTAINTY_SAMPLING,
112:          ERROR_GUIDED_SAMPLING, BOUNDARY_SAMPLING).
113:     """
114: 
