     3	Consolidates pieces that were copy-pasted across the RLCD-family scripts
     4	(`train_rlcd_laya.py`, `analyze_rlcd_ci.py`, `exp_rlcd_loo_transfer.py`,
     5	`exp_rlcd_loo_confirmatory.py`, `exp_geartrain_transfer_probe.py`,
     6	`eval_laya_closed_loop.py`, `exp_rlcd_router_panel.py`):
     7	
     8	  - ``RuleFullBudget`` / ``AlwaysSurrogatePolicy`` — closed-loop baselines
     9	  - ``bootstrap_ci`` — seed/record-clustered percentile bootstrap
    10	  - ``raw_gold`` — valid-action utility dict from a DecisionRecord
    11	    (decision-level metrics are invariant to per-record monotone
    12	    transforms, so no cross-family scale pooling is needed)
    13	  - ``rf_pairwise_and_top1`` — per-record RF ranking metrics
    14	  - ``per_record_laya`` — per-record Laya ranking metrics (correct pairs,
    15	    total pairs, top-1 match, mean log score with the proper_reward floor)
    16	
    17	Only ACTIVE scripts import from here; archived one-shot experiment scripts
    18	(exp_rq*, exp_rq0_5_*, diagnose_*, analyze_rq3_*) intentionally keep their
    19	frozen copies so their historical behavior stays reproducible.
